      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA CAVIAR (1) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a nose (27.34) behind SUNSET CLARICE at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Sure to be about the mark. STAN MONELLI (8) had to overcome a collision in the run but could manage only a distant second (27.60) in a OPEN over 488m at this track. Must include in calculations. ICONIC JET (7) goes very well this course and distance starting 16 times for 10 wins and three minors. Comes off a (27.11) win last time, scoring by 7 lengths in a OPEN over 488m at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. JUST A DUKE (2) placed last time (27.61) at this track in a OPEN, finishing second and beaten 5 lengths. Has already won two times from this draw.",
